  "method": [
    "LibreDWG dwgadd generates scratch R13/R14/R2000 source; its initial named BLOCK is mistakenly linked to modelspace. Correct the modelspace and named-block first/last/delimiter handles, named-block entity owner/mode, line boundary, and HEADER DIMSTYLE in the generated JSON, then serialize and reopen with LibreDWG. Set nolinks=1 for all three inserts so the previous/next references are implicit.",
    "ASan-instrumented candidate reads all frames and visits three no-attribute INSERTs and their following LINE; for each version exercise strict and explicit-partial output in ASCII and Binary with a seeded destination.",
    "ezdxf 1.4.5 independently reopens successful R13 partial outputs and checks the three INSERT positions and block name, following LINE, and target block LINE geometry."
  ],
  "limitations": [
